cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Verified Fast Confirmation"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proof that the Ethereum Fast Confirmation Rule is safe: a confirmed
  block stays on every honest head from the next slot, under explicit synchrony
  and stake assumptions, over a concrete Gloas FFG model tested against the
  consensus-specs Python specification.
